          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **IMPERIAL KNIGHTS TITANIC** unit from your army that Remained Stationary this turn, that is on your defensive line and that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[SUSTAINED HITS 2]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Titanic Duel": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Imperial Knights",
