          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after an **IMPERIAL KNIGHTS TITANIC** unit from your army Falls Back.\n\n**TARGET:** That **IMPERIAL KNIGHTS TITANIC** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Stratagem§Valiant Last Stand": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Imperial Knights",
